  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Can you please add an option for the config.json file to be able to set an automatic resolution at startup for the Desktop part of the META Quest Link VR Chat game? If I load the game in VR: As soon as the Quest 3 goes to desktop the game freezes and I have to manually restart the headset with the power button, because of the resolution of the desktop version is automatically the same as the monitor (1440p).\n\nEdit: Blanke helped me to learn about the launch options in the newest version of the Meta Quest Link software.\n\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/launch-options#resolution-screen-choice-and-native-unity-engine-launch-options\n\nI had to make a shortcut to the Launch.exe in VR Chat installation folder, then add the shortcut to the Meta Quest Link software by going to the library tab,  pressing the plus on the right, click the words \"add it here\", then right click on the short cut, and adding the resolution settings and then clicking save.",
